# ST1 Web Port

## About

**ST1 Web Port** is a project focused on bringing a browser-playable version of **Slendytubbies 1** to computers through the web.

The goal is to make the game playable directly in a modern web browser without requiring players to download a traditional Windows executable.

## Features

- First-person browser gameplay
- Mouse-look controls
- WASD movement
- Sprinting and stamina
- Flashlight system
- Paper collection
- Enemy pursuit
- Pause and restart functionality
- Designed for GitHub Pages hosting

## Controls

| Key | Action |
|---|---|
| W A S D | Move |
| Mouse | Look around |
| Shift | Sprint |
| F | Toggle flashlight |
| E | Collect papers |
| ESC | Release mouse / pause |

## Web Hosting

The project is designed to be hosted using **GitHub Pages**, allowing the game to be accessed from a normal web browser.

Example:

`https://yourusername.github.io/ST1-Web-Port/`

## Project Status

This project is currently a **browser prototype and porting project**.

The original Slendytubbies 1 release was built using an older version of Unity. A direct conversion of the original Windows executable into a modern WebGL game is not possible, so the web version is being developed separately.

## Goal

The long-term goal is to recreate the gameplay and atmosphere of ST1 in a form that can run entirely in a web browser.

## Disclaimer

This project is intended for educational and preservation purposes. It does not include the original Windows executable or proprietary source code.

**Slendytubbies** and its original assets belong to their respective copyright holders.
